      "- [raphaelrrcoelho/formal-mathfin](https://github.com/raphaelrrcoelho/formal-mathfin) \u2014 Apache-2.0 and substantial, but the 2026-06-28 triage found it is not a self-contained, gate-clean Lean Pool import target: the active Lake project depends on `LeanArchitect` and `brownian-motion`, builds every `MathFin` submodule including generated/audit modules, and contains many `#guard_msgs in #print axioms` diagnostics, many `public import Mathlib` modules, and a linter `set_option` waiver. Revisit after the external dependencies and audit/generated surfaces are separated or vendored gate-cleanly."
